---
layout: base.njk
title: Hiking
description: Some of the hikes I've done over the years.
permalink: /hiking/
---
{% from "gallery.njk" import gallery %}

{% macro hikeEntry(hike) %}
  <article class="entry">
    <h3 class="entry__title">{{ hike.name }}</h3>
    <p class="entry__meta">{{ hike.date | longDate }} &middot; {{ hike.location }}</p>
    {{ hike.description | safe }}
    {{ gallery(hike.images, hike.name) }}
  </article>
{% endmacro %}

<h1>Hiking</h1>
<p class="hero__lede">{{ description }}</p>

<div class="highlights">
  <h2>Highlights</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>Summited Mount Kilimanjaro via the Lemosho route, 7 days to reach 19,341 feet,
      the highest point on the African continent. An incredible experience!</li>
    <li>A multi-week east-to-west coast road trip with my sister through national parks
      across the northern US, including Maquoketa Caves, Badlands, Grand Teton,
      Yellowstone, Glacier, and Mount Rainier, before finishing with hiking in British
      Columbia and driving back through Canada.</li>
    <li>Watched the sunrise from Pico do Areeiro in Madeira, then hiked PR1 along the
      ridge to Pico Ruivo, the highest peak on the island, including the trail's
      "Stairway to Heaven" section.</li>
    <li>Working towards completing all 46 Adirondack High Peaks (the "46ers"),
      the 46 mountains in the Adirondacks over 4,000 feet.
      <p class="peaks">
        {# One tick per peak, filled ones first. Built at compile time, so it is
           46 empty spans and no script. #}
        <span class="peaks__ticks" role="img"
              aria-label="{{ outdoors.peaks.completed }} of {{ outdoors.peaks.total }} peaks summited">
          {%- for i in range(0, outdoors.peaks.total) -%}
            <span class="peaks__tick{% if i < outdoors.peaks.completed %} peaks__tick--done{% endif %}"></span>
          {%- endfor -%}
        </span>
        <span class="peaks__count">{{ outdoors.peaks.completed }} / {{ outdoors.peaks.total }}</span>
      </p>
    </li>
  </ul>
</div>

{% set shown = outdoors.hikes %}

{% for hike in shown.slice(0, 10) %}
  {{ hikeEntry(hike) }}
{% endfor %}

{% if shown.length > 10 %}
  <details class="disclosure">
    <summary>Earlier hikes ({{ shown.length - 10 }})</summary>
    {% for hike in shown.slice(10) %}
      {{ hikeEntry(hike) }}
    {% endfor %}
  </details>
{% endif %}
